      <title>从拥抱到担忧：Z世代对AI抢饭碗的焦虑升温</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260819/%E4%BB%8E%E6%8B%A5%E6%8A%B1%E5%88%B0%E6%8B%85%E5%BF%A7Z%E4%B8%96%E4%BB%A3%E5%AF%B9AI%E6%8A%A2%E9%A5%AD%E7%A2%97%E7%9A%84%E7%84%A6%E8%99%91%E5%8D%87%E6%B8%A9/</link>
